-past","text":"Custom Metrics Autoscaler Operator 2.10.1 release notes"},{"depth":2,"slug":"nodes-pods-autoscaling-custom-rn-28_nodes-cma-autoscaling-custom-rn-past","text":"Custom Metrics Autoscaler Operator 2.8 release notes"},{"depth":3,"slug":"nodes-cma-autoscaling-custom-rn-282-174_nodes-cma-autoscaling-custom-rn-past","text":"Custom Metrics Autoscaler Operator 2.8.2-174 release notes"},{"depth":3,"slug":"nodes-cma-autoscaling-custom-rn-282_nodes-cma-autoscaling-custom-rn-past","text":"Custom Metrics Autoscaler Operator 2.8.2 release notes"},{"depth":2,"slug":"additional-resources_nodes-cma-autoscaling-custom-rn-past","text":"Additional resources"}];
